WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.551
Sit down,

00:00:01.551 --> 00:00:02.709
take a breath,

00:00:02.709 --> 00:00:03.868
and reflect.

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:06.634
I truly&nbsp;think reflection can help everyone --

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:08.571
people in every industry,

00:00:08.571 --> 00:00:10.537
at every stage in one's career,

00:00:10.537 --> 00:00:12.931
and in every point in one's life.

00:00:12.931 --> 00:00:16.390
Reflection can be done through a 
variety of different formats:

00:00:16.781 --> 00:00:18.319
purposeful thinking,

00:00:18.319 --> 00:00:20.302
written journal entries,

00:00:20.302 --> 00:00:22.178
audio notes, pitches,

00:00:22.178 --> 00:00:25.257
a discussion with a mentor&nbsp;or honest friend.

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:28.282
The point is to find what works for you

00:00:28.282 --> 00:00:30.481
and to make a regular commitment.

00:00:30.481 --> 00:00:33.895
To&nbsp;examine the events and 
experiences of your lives --

00:00:33.895 --> 00:00:36.442
what worked, what didn't, and why --

00:00:36.442 --> 00:00:41.503
and then, to think about what and how you 
would like to do things differently next time.

00:00:41.503 --> 00:00:44.204
So&nbsp;this might all sound a little fine and dandy,

00:00:44.204 --> 00:00:46.632
and may be obvious or trivial,

00:00:47.243 --> 00:00:48.888
but the truth is,

00:00:48.888 --> 00:00:52.585
so many of us don't take time 
out for regular reflection.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:57.066
But reflection enables you to 
focus on&nbsp;what really matters,

00:00:57.066 --> 00:00:59.100
and to make better choices.

